# live_deploy — Docker build context excludes.
#
# Without this file, `docker build` sends EVERYTHING under live_deploy/
# to the daemon on every build, COPY lines or not — a local venv/,
# __pycache__, and stray data dumps all needlessly slow every build
# down and can end up baked into the image if a COPY line is ever
# broad enough to catch them.

# Credentials — never bake these into an image
config.json
.local_db_password
config.json.bak.*

# A local Python virtualenv some setups keep inside live_deploy/ for
# running custom_scripts/ directly on the host — never needed inside
# the image itself (which installs its own deps via requirements.txt).
venv/
.venv/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# custom_scripts/ output -- real market-data seed dumps, not something
# that belongs baked into the image (same reasoning as .gitignore's
# own entry for this).
custom_scripts/data/

# supervisord.conf's own runtime output (see RUN_GUIDE.md)
logs/*
!logs/.gitkeep

# VCS
.git/
.gitignore
